# Text is stored with LF everywhere, so the gate, the hooks and the docs tool see the same bytes on every OS.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.ogg binary
*.age binary
*.woff2 binary

# The web app's build, committed so an install needs no Node (DR-0705): folded in a PR on GitHub, and never -diff, which
# would hide it from gitleaks. A conflict in it is settled by building again.
packages/docket/src/docket/web/app/** linguist-generated
